OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in overflowing
OL,4,Abath by man investigating leak, inquest
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe body of a 31-year-old Lurgan woman
OL,8,Fwas found in a bath by a maintenance
OL,9,Fman who was investigating a leak in the
OL,10,Fblock of flats she had been living in,
OL,11,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,13,FLaura Marshall's bruised body was
OL,14,Fdiscovered in an overflowing bath at
OL,15,Fher home in Victoria Street in April
OL,16,F2016.
OL,18,FAccording to a police officer, who was
OL,19,Fone of the first on the scene, he
OL,20,Fbelieved a violent assault had taken
OL,21,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
