OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in overflowing
OL,4,Abath by man investigating leak, inquest
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FGary O'Dowd, 38, from Brookfield Avenue
OL,8,Fin Banbridge, was arrested and charged
OL,9,Fwith her murder. He denied any
OL,10,Finvolvement in her death. Two years
OL,11,Flater the case against him was dropped
OL,12,Fafter the Public Prosecution Service
OL,13,F(PPS) decided to withdraw all charges.
